OL,3,GNEWSASDLP meeting changes venue after
OL,4,A'intimidation'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Social Democratic and Labour Party
OL,7,F(SDLP) said a venue that was due to
OL,8,Fhold a town hall meeting hosted by the
OL,9,Fparty cancelled the booking after
OL,10,F"intimidation".
OL,12,FThe original meeting was due to take
OL,13,Fplace in a venue on the Newtownards
OL,14,FRoad in east Belfast but the SDLP event
OL,15,Fhas now moved to the Stormont Hotel on
OL,16,Fthe Upper Newtownards Road.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
