OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASDLP meeting changes venue after
OL,4,A'intimidation'
OL,5,
OL,6,FParty leader Claire Hanna MP said the
OL,7,Fpublic meeting was organised to
OL,8,Ffacilitate conversation about "building
OL,9,Fa better future" and was met "with
OL,10,Fattempts to intimidate the venue
OL,11,Fhosting it".
OL,13,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,14,Fsaid it had not received any reports.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
